# fortuna-ui on Docker Desktop, at http://127.0.0.1:8082.
#
# fortuna-api has no CORS support, so from the browser the UI can only reach an API on its own
# origin -- which development does not have (no Traefik). Use `flutter run -d chrome` with
# --web-browser-flag=--disable-web-security for browser work against a local API, or leave
# FORTUNA_API_BASE_URL empty and use this container to check the build itself.
UI_PORT=127.0.0.1:8082
FORTUNA_API_BASE_URL=
FORTUNA_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
